  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/szd6rGi.png\" width=\"1200\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;<strong>醇酿佳饮与雅致装饰<br></strong></span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">开启\"Let's Do\"系列的首个模组</span></em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\"时光，温柔封存\"</span></em></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">Vinery模组通过直观的机制，为创造奢华饮品提供了全新方式。您将亲手采摘葡萄藤、压榨果实、发酵佳酿，时光会为您沉淀出醇香。</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">随心酿造属于您的葡萄酒。珍视每寸光阴。</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">作为\"Let's Do\"系列的开端，本模组致力于拓展药水效果与奢华饮品的世界。从此告别单调的清水与蜂蜜！</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>葡萄采摘</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在世界各处发现多样的野生葡萄</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">用葡萄藤装饰您的庄园</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">结出真实果实的全新樱桃树<br></span></li>\n</ul><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">提起藤篮，开启葡萄园之旅。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">臻酿工艺</span></strong></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">葡萄压榨罐用于榨取葡萄汁</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">发酵桶将葡萄汁转化为美酒</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">苹果压榨机可将苹果制成苹果汁</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">压榨、发酵、陈酿，这便是生命的醇香脉络。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">装饰元素</span></strong></p><ul>\n<li>葡萄园格架装饰</li>\n<li>乡间小屋家具套装</li>\n<li>全新的樱桃木材质</li>\n<li>契合身份的酿酒师服饰</li>\n<li>展示珍酿的陈列架</li>\n<li>还有我们期待已久的泥土台阶 ;)</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>收获耕耘的成果。</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>倾注匠心之作。</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>珍藏每刻时光。</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>谨献给MissLilitu</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">Let’s Do 系列模组</h1><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flets-do.ch%252fmods%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Let-s-Do-Collection/Let-s-Do-Collection/raw/main/LOGO.png?raw=true\" alt=\"The Let’s Do Collection\"></a></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">支持与社区</h1><p style=\"text-align:center\">Let’s Do因社区而成长。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Let-s-Do-Collection/Let-s-Do-Collection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> • <a href=\"https://discord.gg/Jb2bgpYr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> • <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/u78595058\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fletsdo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/ba492f31-afa4-43bd-b651-f1e2ea1f340b.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
